{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>הפעם האחרת</b><br>My wrap. In the language of Kedar, to cover [like a veil]." "<b>הפעם השלישית</b><br>\"The watchmen found me.\" The wicked kingdom of Javan [Greece]." "They stripped my wrap. For they prevented Israel from observing most of the commandments."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:38.316707608Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}